# NOTE: .adminjs (AdminJS's pre-built frontend bundle, see package.json
# "bundle:admin" and src/admin-module/bundle-admin.ts) is deliberately NOT
# gitignored, even though it's a build artifact rebuilt on every deploy.
# Render's build-to-deploy artifact packaging appears to strip out
# gitignored paths, which silently dropped this folder between a
# successful build step and the running instance — the running app then
# 404'd on every AdminJS asset request (custom dashboard, image upload
# widgets, etc). If you run `npm run bundle:admin` locally, don't commit
# the resulting .adminjs/ changes — they're deploy-time-only output.


.claude
.agents